{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":14.16},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":15.28,"end":31.36},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":32.68,"end":44.64}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":1.28,"text":"首次發現一格時，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":1.76,"end":3.44,"text":"保存到達它的前驅。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":3.52,"end":4.48,"text":"找到終點後，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":4.96,"end":7.92,"text":"沿前驅反向走再反轉順序。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":8.32,"end":10,"text":"所有邊成本相同時，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":10.4,"end":14.16,"text":"BFS 第一次到達終點使用的步數最少。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":15.28,"end":17.2,"text":"選擇有缺口的牆預設，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":17.48,"end":20.76,"text":"把時間軸拉到最後顯示路徑。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":21.12,"end":23.2,"text":"從終點倒走到起點，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":23.28,"end":24.8,"text":"計算邊的數目，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":24.92,"end":27.28,"text":"而不是搜尋發現的總格數。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":28.2,"end":30,"text":"一條路徑包含 6 格，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":30.16,"end":31.36,"text":"需要幾步連接？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":32.68,"end":34.48,"text":"一條路徑包含 6 格，"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":34.8,"end":36.24,"text":"需要幾步連接？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":37.68,"end":41.52,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":42.08,"end":44.64,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}